BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rt - Malaga
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
UID:4080156
DESCRIPTION:<p>A weekend to get moving together&nbsp\;</p></br>\n<p>An RT 
 (Traceurs’ Meet-up) is a gathering of parkour practitioners. We train at
  the best spots in the city\, head out into the countryside and share what
  this sport has given us. This edition is open to the national and interna
 tional community\, with the best weather in Europe for getting active outd
 oors in the middle of October. &nbsp\;</p></br>\n<p>Weekend programme</p>\
 n<p>Provisional and 100% live. The exact locations and any changes will be
  announced via the WhatsApp group. &nbsp\;</p></br>\n<p>Proposed workshops
 &nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Two workshops in the pipeline\, yet to be confirmed. Here
 ’s what’s in the pipeline:&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Creativity&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Fi
 nd your own movement. With Paul (sympanic.parkour) &nbsp\;</p></br>\n<p>Pe
 rformance</p>\n<p>Strength\, control and power. With Alain (tot.move) &nbs
 p\;</p></br>\n<p>RT MÁLAGA Reunión de Traceurs · 24–25 octubre &nbsp\
 ;¿Questions? plataformapepadd@gmail.com · 677 620 665</p></br>\n<p>Price
 : free</p>\n<p>Food: not included</p>\n<p>Accomodation: possible</p>
LOCATION:Málaga\, Province of Málaga\, Spain
ORGANIZER;CN="Parkour Movers, DAPP, Team Coast, Parkour Costa del Sol und 
 PEPADD";PHONE=;WEBSITE="https://clasesdeparkour.es/rt-parkour-malaga/":MAI
 LTO:eggert-frederick@web.de
END:VEVENT
